<title>JAPAN: Dharmala Intiutama launches 5.45% samurai-Yamaichi.</title>
<headline>Dharmala Intiutama launches 5.45% samurai-Yamaichi.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai bond issue was announced by lead-manager Yamaichi Securities on Thursday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  Dharmala Intiutama International BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR	 PT Dharmala Intiutama (DIU)</p>
<p> AMT		 15 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    5.45 pct</p>
<p> MATURITY	  9 July 2002</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  July 9, 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	June 25 and July 7</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     NIS BBB-</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Yamaichi Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Sanwa Bank</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8785</p>
</text>
